s%2Fpronunciation-guide&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AExclamation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt138" id="mwBkA"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Haley-2008-23" id="cite_note-Haley-2008-23" data-mw-footnote-number="19"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBkE"><a href="#cite_ref-Haley-2008_23-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBkI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBkM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Haley-2008-23" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt141" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwBkQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Haley"},"first":{"wt":"Allan"},"date":{"wt":"March 2008"},"title":{"wt":"Punctuation"},"url":{"wt":"http://www.dynamicgraphics.com/dgm/Article/28859/index.html"},"url-status":{"wt":"dead"},"access-date":{"wt":"October 19, 2011"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313182231/http://dynamicgraphics.com/dgm/Article/28859/index.html"},"archive-date":{"wt":"March 13, 2012"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFHaley2008" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt141">Haley, Allan (March 2008). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20120313182231/http://dynamicgraphics.com/dgm/Article/28859/index.html" class="external text" id="mwBkU">"Punctuation"</a>. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.dynamicgraphics.com/dgm/Article/28859/index.html" class="external text" id="mwBkY">the original</a> on March 13, 2012<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBkc">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBkg">October 19,</span> 2011</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Punctuation&amp;rft.date=2008-03&amp;rft.aulast=Haley&amp;rft.aufirst=Allan&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.dynamicgraphics.com%2Fdgm%2FArticle%2F28859%2Findex.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AExclamation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt141" id="mwBkk"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-24" id="cite_note-24" data-mw-footnote-number="20"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBko"><a href="#cite_ref-24" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBks"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBkw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-24" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFTruss2004" about="#mwt146" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwBk0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"harvp","href":"./Template:Harvp"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Truss"},"2":{"wt":"2004"},"page":{"wt":"136"}},"i":0}}]}'>Truss (2004)</a><span about="#mwt146" id="mwBk4">, p.</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt146" id="mwBk8"> </span><span about="#mwt146" id="mwBlA">136</span>: "Everyone knows the exclamation mark – or exclamation point, as it is known in America. It comes at the end of a sentence, is unignorable and hopelessly heavy-handed, and is known in the newspaper world as a screamer, a gasper, a startler or (sorry) a dog's cock."</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Jargon_File-25" id="cite_note-Jargon_File-25" data-mw-footnote-number="21"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBlE"><a href="#cite_ref-Jargon_File_25-0" id="mwBlI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBlM">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-Jargon_File_25-1" id="mwBlQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBlU">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Jargon_File-25" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt149" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwBlY" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"http://www.catb.org/jargon/html/B/bang.html"},"title":{"wt":"bang"},"work":{"wt":"[[The Jargon File]]"},"version":{"wt":"4.4.8"},"access-date":{"wt":"July 9, 2018"},"archive-date":{"wt":"June 19, 2018"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20180619091226/http://catb.org/jargon/html/B/bang.html"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt149" id="mwBlc"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.catb.org/jargon/html/B/bang.html" class="external text" id="mwBlg">"bang"</a>. <i id="mwBlk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Jargon_File" title="The Jargon File" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBlo">The Jargon File</a></i>. 4.4.8. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180619091226/http://catb.org/jargon/html/B/bang.html" class="external text" id="mwBls">Archived</a> from the original on June 19, 2018<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBlw">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBl0">July 9,</span> 2018</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Jargon+File&amp;rft.atitle=bang&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.catb.org%2Fjargon%2Fhtml%2FB%2Fbang.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AExclamation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt149" id="mwBl4"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-26" id="cite_note-26" data-mw-footnote-number="22"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBl8"><a href="#cite_ref-26" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBmA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBmE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-26" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt152" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwBmI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Poe"},"first":{"wt":"Edgar Allen"},"title":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;The Tell-Tale Heart&apos;&apos;"},"url":{"wt":"http://www.eapoe.org/works/tales/thearta.htm"},"website":{"wt":"The Edgar Allen Poe Society of Baltimore"},"access-date":{"wt":"June 5, 2010"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20171123052256/https://www.eapoe.org/works/tales/thearta.htm"},"archive-date":{"wt":"November 23, 2017"},"quote":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;\"Villains!\" I shrieked, \"dissemble no more! I admit the deed! — tear up the planks! — here, here! — it is the beating of his hideous heart!\"&apos;&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFPoe" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt152">Poe, Edgar Allen. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20171123052256/https://www.eapoe.org/works/tales/thearta.htm" class="external text" id="mwBmM">"<i id="mwBmQ">The Tell-Tale Heart</i>"</a>. <i id="mwBmU">The Edgar Allen Poe Society of Baltimore</i>. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.eapoe.org/works/tales/thearta.htm" class="external text" id="mwBmY">the original</a> on November 23, 2017<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBmc">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBmg">June 5,</span> 2010</span>. <q id="mwBmk"><i id="mwBmo">"Villains!" I shrieked, "dissemble no more! I admit the deed! — tear up the planks! — here, here! — it is the beating of his hideous heart!"</i></q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Edgar+Allen+Poe+Society+of+Baltimore&amp;rft.atitle=The+Tell-Tale+Heart&amp;rft.aulast=Poe&amp;rft.aufirst=Edgar+Allen&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.eapoe.org%2Fworks%2Ftales%2Fthearta.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AExclamation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt152" id="mwBms"></span></span></li>
